{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mahjong Solitaire Pro offers a relaxing yet engaging experience, where every match brings a sense of satisfaction and focus. With each cleared board, you\u2019ll feel a mix of calm and accomplishment, making it the perfect way to unwind after a hard day at work.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/287f123eb127448f5a10058c8587665c.gif?t=1742408233\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Mahjong Solitaire Pro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mahjong Solitaire Pro is a relaxing yet rewarding take on the classic tile-matching game. Every move brings a sense of focus and satisfaction as you clear the board piece by piece. Whether you're unwinding or sharpening your mind, the game provides a soothing yet engaging challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/extras/4d5846e05f3ae859c7bd5aae9f485a9e.gif?t=1742408233\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With helpful hints and a unique shuffle feature to refresh the board, you\u2019ll always have a way forward. Customize your experience, test your strategy, and enjoy the timeless joy of mahjong solitaire at your own pace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586670?t=1742408233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586670?t=1742408233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/fffe61323a73fc10233ef27c5b5a937a92d2c363/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742408233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586670/fffe61323a73fc10233ef27c5b5a937a92d2c363/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742408233","categories":[{"descr